{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Find object, move to location, check properties, perform specific task, take object. If not found, scan area.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToLocation    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ScanObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = DoSpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    />",
